{"abstract":"This chapter presents an introduction to graph colouring algorithms. The focus is on vertex-colouring algorithms that work for general classes of graphs with worst-case performance guarantees in a sequential model of computation. The presentation aims to demonstrate the breadth of available techniques and is organized by algorithmic paradigm.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Husfeldt, Thore"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-383043"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Algorithmic Paradigms","Graph colouring","Sequential Computation","Vertex Colouring Algorithms","Worst Case Performance"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"graph colouring algorithms","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84952684504","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-383043","identifier":[{"id":"84952684504","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-783757ef-beca-45a3-9c54-2df29294c16c"],"keyword":["Algorithmic Paradigms","Graph Colouring","Sequential Computation","Vertex-Colouring Algorithms","Worst-Case Performance"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-5298A758523192DC4A9EF71BEE6676A4"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science","IT University of Copenhagen, Theoretical Computer Science, Algorithms","The Department, Theoretical Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"