{"abstract":"Valproceduren. Valhemligheten är inte särskilt viktig för svenskar. Den uppfattas som en meningslös detalj, som man ändå bara vill utnyttja om man har dolda och oärliga avsikter. Men syftet med valhemligheten är att skydda valets integritet, inte väljarens privata sfär. Valhemligheten bör helt enkelt inte vara valfri.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Husfeldt, Thore"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-382347"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Integritetsskydd","Svenska val","Valhemlighet","Valproceduren","Väljarskydd"],"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"valhemligheten bör inte vara valfri","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.dagenssamhalle.se/debatt/saett-stopp-foer-det-ovaerdiga-kaoset-med-valsedlar-15889","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-382347","ids":["itu-4868829e-d52d-4fcf-a39a-78fd6462e2fe"],"keyword":["Integritetsskydd","Svenska val","Valhemlighet","Valproceduren","Väljarskydd"],"lang":"English","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-2A4433C053A3968D25DD137D25FF200F"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.dagenssamhalle.se/debatt/saett-stopp-foer-det-ovaerdiga-kaoset-med-valsedlar-15889","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science","The Department, Theoretical Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","co