"gb","key":"university of oxford","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Oxford","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Javier","key":"esparzaped","last":"Esparza","name":"Esparza, Javier","rank":1,"role":"Editor","rolecode":"ped"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Pierre","key":"fraigniaudpau","last":"Fraigniaud","name":"Fraigniaud, Pierre","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Thore","key":"husfeldtpau","last":"Husfeldt","locid":"472021c7-73cc-44ba-a4ef-70cd2bed8601","name":"Husfeldt, Thore","orcid":"0000-0001-9078-4512","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Elias","key":"koutsoupiaspau","last":"Koutsoupias","name":"Koutsoupias, Elias","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-662-43951-7","eisbn":["9783662439517"],"isbn":["9783662439500"],"issn":["03029743"],"pages":"619","publisher":"Springer","series":"Lecture Notes in Computer Science","status":"p","volume":"8573"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-4e6292c3-335b-478e-a11e-090207d92a1e"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Automata, Languages, and Programming : 41st International Colloquium, ICALP 2014, Copenhagen, Denmark, July 8-11, 2014, Proceedings, Part II","type":"Book","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-382438","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"We show conditional lower bounds for well-studied #P-hard problems: The number of satisfying assignments of a 2-CNF formula with n variables cannot be computed in time exp(o(n)), and the same is true for computing the number of all independent sets in an n-vertex graph. The permanent of an n× n matrix with entries 0 and 1 cannot be computed in time exp(o(n)). The Tutte polynomial of an n-vertex multigraph cannot be computed in time exp(o(n)) at most evaluation points (x,y) in the case of multigraphs, and it cannot be computed in time exp(o(n/poly log n)) in the case of simple graphs. Our lower bounds are relative to (variants of) the Exponential Time Hypothesis (ETH), which says that the satisfiability of n-variable 3-CNF formulas cannot be decided in time exp(o(n)). We relax this hypothesis by introducing its counting version #ETH; namely, that the satisfying assignments cannot be counted in time exp(o(n)). In order to use #ETH for our lower bounds, we transfer the sparsification lemma for d-CNF formulas to the counting setting.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Dell, Holger","Husfeldt, Thore","Marx, Dániel","Taslaman, Nina Sofia","Wahlén, Martin"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-381446"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Germany","Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Humboldt University of Berlin","Lund University"],"keyword":["Conditional lower bounds","ETH counting version of ETH","Exponential Time Hypothesis ETH","P hard problems","Sparsification lemma"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"exponential time complexity of the permanent and the tutte polynomial","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84906849708","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-381446","identifier":[{"id":"84906849708","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-0c67d9dd-eb0a-40bf-b565-073d93d06193"],"keyword":["#ETH (counting version of ETH)","#P-hard problems","Conditional lower bounds","Exponential Time Hypothesis (ETH)","Sparsification lemma"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-0AC01895D6543044A266D7231408E51D"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"de","key":"humboldt university of berlin","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Humboldt University of Berlin","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science","IT University of Copenhagen, Theoretical Computer Science, Algorithms","The Department, Theoretical Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"se","key":"lund university","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Lund University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Holger","key":"dellpau","last":"Dell","name":"Dell, Holger","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Thore","key":"husfeldtpau","last":"Husfeldt","locid":"472021c7-73cc-44ba-a4ef-70cd2bed8601","name":"Husfeldt, Thore","orcid":"0000-0001-9078-4512","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Dániel","key":"marxpau","last":"Marx","name":"Marx, Dániel","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Nina Sofia","key":"taslamanpau","last":"Taslaman","name":"Taslaman, Nina Sofia","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Martin","key":"wahlénpau","last":"Wahlén","name":"Wahlén, Martin","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/2635812","issn":["15496325","15496333"],"issn_org":["15496325"],"issue":"4","journal":"ACM Transactions on Algorithms","paperid":"21","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery","status":"p","title":"ACM Transactions on Algorithms","title_org":"A C M Transactions on Algorithms","volume":"10"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-0c67d9dd-eb0a-40bf-b565-073d93d06193"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Exponential Time Complexity of the Permanent and the Tutte Polynomial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-381446","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"author_count":1,"contributors":["Husfeldt, Thore"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-382051"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"den personlige virkelighed","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-382051","ids":["itu-353f1145-a9e9-431c-a550-f7da46675ae2"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-0760A610856F15DE536BB63918E0A22F"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science","IT University of Copenhagen, Theoretical Computer Science, Algorithms","The Department, Theoretical Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thore","key":"husfeldtpau","last":"Husfeldt","locid":"472021c7-73cc-44ba-a4ef-70cd2bed8601","name":"Husfeldt, Thore","orcid":"0000-0001-9078-4512","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["01064142","09057633"],"issn_org":["01064142"],"issue":"27","newspaper":"Weekendavisen","publisher":"Berlingske Media AS","publisher_org":"Berlingske Media A/S","status":"p","title":"Weekendavisen"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-353f1145-a9e9-431c-a550-f7da46675ae2"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Den personlige virkelighed","type":"Newspaper Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-382051","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"We investigate adjacency labeling schemes for graphs of bounded degree Δ = O(1). In particular, we present an optimal (up to an additive constant) log n + O(1) adjacency labeling scheme for bounded degree trees. The latter scheme is derived from a labeling scheme for bounded degree outerplanar graphs. Our results complement a similar bound recently obtained for bounded depth trees [Fraigniaud and Korman, SODA 2010], and may provide new insights for closing the long standing gap for adjacency in trees [Alstrup and Rauhe, FOCS 2002]. We also provide improved labeling schemes for bounded degree planar graphs. Finally, we use combinatorial number systems and present an improved adjacency labeling schemes for graphs of bounded degree Δ with (e + 1) √n <Δ ≤ n/5.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Adjiashvili, David","Rotbart, Noy Galil"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-462312"],"event":{"acronym":"ICALP","end":"2014-07-11","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2014-07-08","title":"International Colloquium on Automata, Languages, and Programming 2014","year":"2014"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["Switzerland"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","ETH Zürich"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"labeling schemes for bounded degree graphs","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-462312","identifier":[{"id":"84904188653","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-73350e3a-212b-4cb9-adf6-cc95a195813b"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-F37C12B8F1D6880D230D82452F7B5C70"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","c